~ kid_step1
Mother: Hello, sweetie! Look at this little buddy I bought you. I'll explain what the text is later... but for now, you should know that raising a pet is a big responsibility!
Mother: Everything you need is in your house or in town. First, let's check your inventory. Press the Supplies button to see what you have!
=> END

~ kid_step2
Mother: Now let's look at your buddy's status. You need to keep track of their Hunger, Thirst, and Energy. Press P or click the Needs button to open their Needs!
Mother: The bars show their current stats. Bring them home to feed them when Hunger or Thirst is low. If they are tired, they need to sleep. If they get sick, take them to the Vet!
=> END

~ kid_step3
Mother: We are out of pet food and water! You'll need to buy supplies at the Shop in town. But to buy things, you need money.
Mother: Let's check your account and budget. Open the Finances menu so we can see how we are doing!
=> END

~ kid_step4
Mother: Since you're just a kid, I will take care of the house rent and fund a weekly allowance of ${{GameState.weekly_allowance}} for you! But if you want to earn extra cash for your buddy, you can do chores around the house. If you do the ball fetch chore, I will give you ${{GameState.ball_chore}} for every ball collected!
Mother: Oh dear, your buddy's health is quite low. I want you to go down the path to the Vet in the bottom-left of town to get a checkup. Go on, I'll be waiting here!
=> END


~ teen_step1
Mother: Welcome home, dear! I'm glad you're learning to care for your new buddy, but now that you're a teenager, you need to start learning about real-world finances.
Mother: I can still provide a small weekly allowance of ${{GameState.weekly_allowance}} and cover your rent, but you'll need to earn your own spending money. First, let's check your inventory. Press the Supplies button!
=> END

~ teen_step2
Mother: Now let's look at your buddy's status. Press P or click the Needs button to open their Needs!
Mother: You need to keep their Hunger, Thirst, and Energy high, and watch their health. If they are sick, take them to the Vet!
=> END

~ teen_step3
Mother: No supplies! You'll need to buy kibble and water at the Shop in town. To see how much cash we have, open the Finances menu!
=> END

~ teen_step4
Mother: As a teenager, you are old enough to get a part-time job! I've arranged for three different employers in town to offer you shifts. You can work up to 3 days a week.
Mother: Before we get started, which job would you like to take? Each has its own pay and special benefits!
do GameState.trigger_job_selection()
=> END

~ teen_step5
Mother: {{GameState.active_job_display_name}}? A wonderful choice! {{GameState.active_job_benefit_description}}
Mother: Now, your buddy's health is low, so follow the path to the Vet for a checkup. Good luck!
=> END


~ mother_idle
if GameState.selected_pathway == "kid"
	Mother: Hello sweetie! Chores around the house pay ${{GameState.ball_chore}} per ball. Keep caring for your buddy!
else
	Mother: Hello dear! Make sure to complete your scheduled work shifts this week!
=> END


~ day2_teen_wake
Mother: Wake up, {{GameState.player_name}}! It's time to head to your job.
Mother: And don't forget to drop your buddy off at daycare first — none of these jobs want you bringing your dog in to work with you!
=> END

~ day2_adult_wake
Me: Ugh... morning already. Time to head to work.
Me: I'd better drop my buddy off at daycare on the way — none of these jobs want me bringing my dog in to work.
=> END


~ day0_teen_work
Mother: Hey {{GameState.player_name}}, the shop is pretty close to your job at {{GameState.active_job_location}}. You should go and get a shift there!
=> END

~ day0_adult_work
Me: Hey, the shop is pretty close to my job at {{GameState.active_job_location}}. I should head over and pick up a shift there.
=> END
